/v1/","context":{"app_id":5038140,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-5038140","metric":"price_final","observed_at":"2026-10-26T10:31:27Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5038140,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-5038140","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T10:31:27Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5038140,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-5038140","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T10:31:27Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5038140,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-5038140","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T10:58:14Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5209920","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5038140-1846651706696121","game_id":"steam-5038140","kind":"announcement","title":"STEAM NEXT FEST: THE CITY IS STILL UNREASONABLE","summary":"Steam Next Fest started on October 19, and An Unreasonable Number of Zombies is in it. The free demo is already out, so if you've been waiting for an excuse, this is it.WHAT'S CHANGED SINCE LAUNCHThe demo has only been out for a few days, and testers have already reshaped it:Right mouse scopes on the Rooftop, there's a wind readout under your crosshair, and the jump into stage 2 is a step, not a wall.Tutorial tips on The Wall pause the action, so you can actually read them.Pharmacy fights feel s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T17:16:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696121","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038140-1846018067932437","game_id":"steam-5038140","kind":"announcement","title":"THE BUG HUNT GIVEAWAY","summary":"The demo is out, the city is overrun, and somewhere in there are bugs I haven't found yet. Help me find them - and you could win the full game. HOW IT WORKSPlay the free demo and find something broken, confusing or just plain wrong.Open FEEDBACK from the pause menu or the end-of-night screen and tell me what happened.Tick ENTER THE BUG HUNT GIVEAWAY and leave your Steam name or an email address.Every valid bug report is one ticket. When the hunt ends, I'll draw 5 winners at random - each gets a ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T07:36:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932437","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038140-1846018067929946","game_id":"steam-5038140","kind":"announcement","title":"HOW TO PLAY THE DEMO (AND WHEN TO WALK AWAY)","summary":"The demo is free, seven districts long, and ten nights deep. Most of it teaches itself , every district walks you through its own job the first time you enter it. Three things it does not explain, and they are the three that cost people a night's work. 1. TWO CURRENCIESCOINS come off dead zombies and buy guns and patch-ups inside the run. They are gone the moment the night ends, so hoarding them is just losing them slowly — spend every one. LOOT comes off civilians and shelves, buys permanent up","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T14:39:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929946","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038140-1846018067929938","game_id":"steam-5038140","kind":"announcement","title":"AN UNREASONABLY EARLY DEMO","summary":"Yup, it's early; the Next Fest doesn't start until October 19, but the city is being overwhelmed by an UNREASONABLE NUMBER OF ZOMBIES, and it needs your help! Hit Download Demo on the store page, and you're in. WHAT'S IN ITSeven districts, each with its own way to play and its own way to get LOOT: hold the safehouse doors, strip the pharmacy shelves, keep a gatling on the wall, snipe from the rooftop, get civilians onto the night bus, scan the queue at the checkpoint, and bring down the Big Dadd","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T14:37:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929938","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038140-1845383656377153","game_id":"steam-5038140","kind":"announcement","title":"A REASONABLY EASY DEMO OVERVIEW","summary":"The free demo opens for Steam Next Fest on October 19 - and it asks a few things of you that most zombie games don't. So I made a short video that walks you through all of it before you drop in: what you're after, how you keep it, and how a night plays out. Wishlist now so you get a ping the moment the demo is playable. ONE GOAL: LOOTThe city is falling, one district at a time. Each night you pick one district, fight through it, and try to come out with LOOT. Every district gets you LOOT a diffe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T10:58:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377153","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038140-1844751498226068","game_id":"steam-5038140","kind":"update","title":"AN UNREASONABLE DEMO UPDATE","summary":"The free demo goes live for Steam Next Fest on October 19 - and it has grown a lot since my testers first got their hands on it. Here is everything that will be in it when it opens: every lesson rebuilt, a controller that works everywhere, new scopes on The Rooftop, a chainsaw that finally sounds like one, and a lot more blood. Wishlist now so you get a ping the moment the demo is playable. Learning the ropesEvery district's lesson has been rebuilt. If you were one of my testers, you'll see them","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T22:27:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498226068","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038140-1844751498220616","game_id":"steam-5038140","kind":"announcement","title":"DEVBLOG 03 - \"HOW HARD SHOULD IT BE?\"","summary":"Last time I wrote about making infection something you feel. This time it's the step before that: how hard each district should be in the first place.\"Too hard\" depends on who's playing. Someone picking up the controls for the first time and someone chasing a stage 5 finish with every perk bought need very different things from the same district. So I wrote down what each of them should get, and then built a way to check it. FOUR RULES. Every district has to pass four rules: Do nothing and you l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T08:25:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498220616","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038140-1844115010497094","game_id":"steam-5038140","kind":"announcement","title":"AN UNREASONABLY LOGICAL DEMO","summary":"The upcoming demo gives you seven districts and ten nights, with one deploy per night. The city starts at a 38.9% infection level, City Hall is completely overrun, and six of the seven districts are locked. Where do you go first? I didn't want to guess. So I deployed an algorithmic simulation paired with the game's rule set, the same code the demo runs - and had it play the ten nights over and over until it found the best route. Nights 1-4: open the road. Old Town, Market Square, Chapel Hill, Ha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T12:38:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010497094","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038140-1843481262698437","game_id":"steam-5038140","kind":"announcement","title":"DEVBLOG 02 - \"MAKING INFECTION MATTER\"","summary":"The challenge I’m working on right now is making district infection something you feel when you play. The map shows a percentage, but a higher number doesn’t yet mean a harder fight.I’m exploring two connected ideas: faster zombie spawns at higher infection levels, and adjusting how much infection each completed stage removes. The charts below help me compare the numbers before putting those changes into the game.MORE INFECTION. One idea I'm testing on paper is to tie district infection to spawn","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T22:13:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262698437","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038140-1843481262694324","game_id":"steam-5038140","kind":"announcement","title":"DEVBLOG 01 - \"THE ENDGAME PROBLEM\"","summary":"First of these. The plan is one whenever something worth showing changes, rather than one a week padded out to look busy. Nearly all my time right now is going into balance and the endgame, so that is what this one is about. The release city. Twenty-two districts, and you play one of them a night. The full city is 22 districts. The only thing that brings a district's infection down is CLEAR, which means going there and playing it. You play one district a night. So the soonest you can get back to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T07:41:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262694324","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038140-1842846814456423","game_id":"steam-5038140","kind":"announcement","title":"CONTROLLER SUPPORT","summary":"The (pre-release) demo now plays start to finish on a controller. Menus, the city map, all seven districts, the pause screen, the upgrade tree. No point where you have to reach for a keyboard or a mouse. That sounds like a small thing...but it wasn't, and the reason is worth writing down, because this game is not built the way most games are. The map Harbor Gate is the exception, because it is the one district with no guns in it. Nothing to aim at means the right stick has no job, so the whole c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T17:55:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814456423","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038140-1842846814442295","game_id":"steam-5038140","kind":"announcement","title":"AN UNREASONABLE NUMBER OF ACHIEVEMENTS","summary":"Steam Achievements FTW The achievements fall into six groups. FIRST NIGHTS - getting through the early ones and working out that leaving is the win. \\THE BET - whether you SECURE what is ON YOU or go back out for more. Every one of these is a decision, not a task.THE DISTRICTS - at least one for every playable district (for the most part), keyed to whatever that district is actually about.KNOCKING -Knockity Knock! Knock! Time to evacuate. Save civilians...if you can. THE GORE - what the voxel de","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T05:36:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814442295","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038140-1842212951305468","game_id":"steam-5038140","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO LANDS AT STEAM NEXT FEST, OCTOBER 19","summary":"The playable demo of An Unreasonable Number of Zombies goes live when the Steam Next Fest starts on October 19, and stays up for the full week until October 26. The demo consists of 6 of the roughly 20 districts in the full game. Every third wave, the game stops and asks if you want to keep on pushing on - risking the loot you've gathered- or pull out. It's a gamble, baby! IT'S ALL ABOUT THE COINS & LOOTEvery third wave, the game stops and asks you one question. You are holding loot you have not","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T11:38:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951305468","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038140-1841579228679234","game_id":"steam-5038140","kind":"announcement","title":"NEW MODE: ZOMBOKRAKEN","summary":"The city spent the year dumping bodies in the harbor. Tonight the harbor hands them back as one animal.One trawler, one gunner, the whole mouth of the harbor to run in. Steer with A/D, work the throttle with W/S, shoot what comes down at you.Read the wind-upA limb rears, the frame reddens, a mark lands on the water. It commits to a spot in both axes, so the dodge is helm and throttle together. Take its head off and the blow lands blunt instead.The sacs are a clock you can seeTwo dozen ripen on t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T18:51:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228679234","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038140-1841579228668132","game_id":"steam-5038140","kind":"announcement","title":"AN UNREASONABLE NUMBER OF LANGUAGES","summary":"An Unreasonable Number of Zombies has an unreasonable number of store pages. Eighteen, not counting English. The whole page, the description, the short blurb, the section headers, the content warning, now exists in every one of them. Simplified ChineseTraditional ChineseSpanish (Spain)Spanish (Latin America)Portuguese (Brazil)RussianUkrainianGermanFrenchItalianPolishCzechTurkishJapaneseKoreanVietnameseThaiIndonesian Two Spanishes, two Chineses Steam treats Spain and Latin America as separate lan","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T09:50:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228668132","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038140-1841579228665043","game_id":"steam-5038140","kind":"announcement","title":"NIGHT BUS - TOWER DEFENCE MODE","summary":"New Mode: Night Busa new way to lose everything you just earned There is a bus. It is going to drive one street tonight, and it is not going to wait for you. Night Bus is a tower defence mode wearing the wrong coat. You do not carry a gun in it. You carry a torch and a wallet, and everything you build gets built while a horde is already walking toward you. Knock. Load. Build.Every civilian in the district is behind a door, and every door is in the half of the street the horde walks through. Knoc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T10:13:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228665043","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5038140-1841579228661929","game_id":"steam-5038140","kind":"announcement","title":"THE STORE PAGE IS LIVE. 🧟","summary":"An Unreasonable Number of Zombies now has a home on Steam. Distinct survival scenarios scattered across a city under siege, each one demanding something different from you. Secure what you've earned and walk away safe, or push your luck for a bigger score.A free demo is coming for Steam Next Fest this October, so you'll be able to try it yourself soon.If this sounds like your kind of chaos, wishlisting now genuinely helps, especially this early. Thanks for being here for the start of it!https://","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T08:43:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.n